        <item>
            <title>2.20.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 23:26:34 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>97</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.20.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes

- **A peer name set with `/rename` now survives a restart.** The name lived only as long as the CLI process that published it, so quitting Canopy threw it away and the next launch generated a fresh one. Names are now remembered per session and handed back when that session starts again.
]]></description>
